{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Spec SDD 合規檢查",
  "description": "Spec 檔案被編輯時，提醒執行 superpowers:spec-scan（canonical：skills/spec-scan/SKILL.md）",
  "version": "2",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      ".kiro/specs/**/requirements.md",
      ".kiro/specs/**/design.md",
      ".kiro/specs/**/tasks.md",
      "docs/superpowers/specs/**/*.md"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Spec 檔案剛被編輯。請考慮執行 `superpowers:spec-scan`（或 `/scan-spec`），檢查：CP-xx Correctness Properties、precondition/postcondition、Wiring Matrix、BDD/TDD 任務結構。若本次修改純屬排版/錯字，可略過。Canonical 內容在 `skills/spec-scan/SKILL.md`。"
  }
}
